<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-UKRAINE BEAT ALBANIA 3-0 IN UNDER-21 MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UKRAINE BEAT ALBANIA 3-0 IN UNDER-21 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>GUADIX, Spain 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a European under-21 Group nine soccer match played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Albania 0 Ukraine 3 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Jakiv Kripak 48, Yury Seleznev 52, Gennadi Moroz 78</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000.</p>
